  "body": "Complete portable contextual county query: 1,328 full source records, 833 county joins, 446 source-defined registered fractions and 387 missing rates. All previous source records and 19 entire geometries remain unchanged. The two matching Monroe sources are retained, never added; the explicitly defined statewide source is selected once. Includes all numerical inputs, original Census identity archives, geometry checks, executable code and checksums. Not certified election boundaries, completed counting, demographic participation or a live explorer update."
